  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Reporting, and Verification (MRV) Framework Development for the Regenerative Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a robust MRV framework that leverages participatory processes, advanced data collection tools as possible, and stakeholder collaboration to ensure accuracy and scalability. The framework will capture field-level impacts and ensure compliance with international standards, enabling the key stakeholders including implementing partners, funders, investors, and private sector partners to make decisions &amp; use the data for communication of their sustainability efforts</narrative>
